# L §5.19: "A window belongs in an attribute (a giver's acquisition day), never in on, the observation's or a leg's
# (LOAD-LEG)." Here a leg's on is a window. (Writer 6; L5_19_window_in_on is the observation's.)
=== m.tally
model hh
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source bank "bank"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
input bank_rows: observed
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
place unexplained: outside lives 1900-01-01..

version stmt
  cite bank
  governs 2026-02
  known 2026-03-02
  covers konto
  pad konto from unexplained
  opening[konto] = 5 000.00 PLN at 2026-02-01 start "wyciąg"
  bank_rows[r1] = (on: 2026-02-05, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to world amount 100.00 PLN on window(2026-02-03, 2026-02-05)) "line 1"

ask q: bal(konto, 2026-02-28)
=== expect
refused: LOAD-LEG ...
